title Cassette after a merge: the recordings list with the new take (Take 008) on top and highlighted, the notice Merged 3 takes into Take 008
sizes 480x480
ppmm 667
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_MERGE done
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
expect text "Take 008"
expect text "Merged 3 takes into Take 008"
shot merged
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
